{"id":"8065a8c1d679fb1f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Iteration Strategy","display":"df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy — ZFC Inner4 Iteration Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy — ZFC Inner4 Iteration Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strategy — ZFC Inner4 Iteration Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f49f8a86fc4b13b\" href=\"?note=0f49f8a86fc4b13b\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\Sigma\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> is a class function on set-sized limit-length iteration trees over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f49f8a86fc4b13b\" href=\"?note=0f49f8a86fc4b13b\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4IterationStrategy}_S\\subseteq V\\times\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4IterationStrategy}_S\\subseteq V\\times\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> is a metatheoretic predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4IterationStrategy}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal T,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S(\\Sigma(\\mathcal T),\\mathcal T)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4IterationStrategy}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal T,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S(\\Sigma(\\mathcal T),\\mathcal T)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategies covering iteration trees of arbitrary set size are class functions; they cannot be set functions whose domain is a comprehension over all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md","status":"resolved","id":"0f49f8a86fc4b13b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3$, $\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V$, and $\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]], [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]], [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3$, $\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V$, and $\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]], [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]], [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md","status":"resolved","id":"0f49f8a86fc4b13b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3$, $\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V$, and $\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]], [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]], [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree10-cofinal-branch.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4IterationStrategy}_S\\subseteq V\\times\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4IterationStrategy}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal T,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTree10CofinalBranch}_S(\\Sigma(\\mathcal T),\\mathcal T)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-inner4-iteration-strateg